---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Landlord Communication Scripts Ghana | Rent, Inspection &amp; Notices" description="Ready-to-use scripts for Ghanaian landlords — rent reminders, inspection notices, maintenance requests, and tenant communications.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/products/" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:1rem; display:inline-block;">← Back to Products</a>

      <h1>Landlord Communication Scripts Pack</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">Professional, ready-to-use communication templates for every landlord scenario. WhatsApp messages, formal letters, and SMS scripts that are legally sound and tenant-friendly.</p>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What's Included</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Rent Payment Reminders:</strong> Polite initial reminder through final notice</li>
          <li><strong>Late Payment Notices:</strong> Act 220-compliant late fee notifications</li>
          <li><strong>Inspection Notices:</strong> 7-day notice for property inspections</li>
          <li><strong>Maintenance Coordination:</strong> Request for access to perform repairs</li>
          <li><strong>Lease Renewal:</strong> Templates for annual lease renewal</li>
          <li><strong>Tenant Violation Notices:</strong> Professional escalation from warning to formal notice</li>
          <li><strong>Eviction Notice (Form 9):</strong> Legal eviction notice under Act 220</li>
          <li><strong>Dispute Resolution:</strong> Professional communication for rent disputes</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp & SMS Versions:</strong> Casual and formal variants for different channels</li>
          <li><strong>PDF & DOCX Formats:</strong> Edit and customize as needed</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0;">
        <h2>Choose Your Tier</h2>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap:1.5rem; margin-top:1.5rem;">

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Basic</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Essential scripts for common landlord communications.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 29</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>2 script packs</li>
              <li>Formal + WhatsApp versions</li>
              <li>PDF & DOCX formats</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/385q56339p" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Pro</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Comprehensive scripts for all common landlord scenarios.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 49</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>4 script packs</li>
              <li>Multiple message variants</li>
              <li>Fully customizable</li>
              <li>Act 220 compliant</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/215vd95328" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h3>Script Categories</h3>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Rent Payments:</strong> Gentle reminders, escalating notices, late fee notifications</li>
          <li><strong>Property Inspections:</strong> Formal 7-day notice, pre-inspection checklist reminder</li>
          <li><strong>Maintenance & Repairs:</strong> Emergency access requests, scheduled maintenance notice</li>
          <li><strong>Lease Renewal:</strong> Renewal offer, price increase notice, non-renewal</li>
          <li><strong>Tenant Violations:</strong> Warning, formal notice, final eviction notice</li>
          <li><strong>Dispute Resolution:</strong> Professional communication for rent disputes and disagreements</li>
          <li><strong>Formality Levels:</strong> Casual (WhatsApp), formal (letter), legal (Act 220-compliant)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#fff3cd; border-radius:8px;">
        <p style="margin:0;"><strong>Act 220 & L.I. 369 Compliant:</strong> All legal scripts are written to comply with Ghana's Rent Act, 1963 and associated regulations. Legally defensible and professionally appropriate.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/contact/" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Have Questions? Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
